//
// FigureItNow7.rc.in - Windows resource script template.
//
// Embeds the application icon into the executable so Windows Explorer (and the taskbar /
// installer shortcuts) can show it. The Qt resource Icons.qrc is not read by the shell: it only
// exists inside the Qt runtime. CMake fills in @FIN_APP_ICON@ at configure time with the
// build-tree path of the .ico generated from icons/main.png by cmake/PngToIco.ps1; qmake gets the
// same resource through "RC_ICONS" in FigureItNow7.pro.

IDI_ICON1 ICON "@FIN_APP_ICON@"
